    <chapter>
      <heading>OnTheWing — Your Digital Nature Journal</heading>
      <p>On The Wing is a web application that makes it easy for you to record your observations of nature while you're out and about.
      At the end of the day, you can review your observations, make notes, and keep a nature journal.</p>

      <section>
